{"speciesId":499,"names":{"fr":"Grotichon","es":"Pignite","en":"Pignite","ja":"チャオブー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand le feu dans son corps s’embrase, sa vitesse et son agilité augmentent. En cas d’urgence, il crache de la fumée."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ce qu’il mange devient du combustible pour le feu dans son estomac. La colère vivifie ses flammes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Whatever it eats becomes fuel for the flame in its stomach. When it is angered, the intensity of the flame increases."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Plus il a mangé de Baies, plus il a de combustible, et il peut donc dégager davantage de flammes et de puissance."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuanto más come, más combustible tiene en su interior para avivar sus llamas, con lo que también aumenta su poder."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"食べるほどに 燃やすものが 増えて 胃袋内の 炎が 強まり パワーも どんどん あふれ出すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand le feu dans son corps s’embrase, sa vitesse et son agilité augmentent. En cas d’urgence, il crache de la fumée."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando las llamas de su interior se avivan, aumenta su velocidad y agilidad. Emite humo si está en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体内の 炎が 燃え上がると 動きの キレと スピードが 増す。 ピンチになると 煙を 噴き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Plus il a mangé de Baies, plus il a de combustible, et il peut donc dégager davantage de flammes et de puissance."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuanto más come, más combustible tiene en su interior para avivar sus llamas, con lo que también aumenta su poder."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"食べるほどに 燃やすものが 増えて 胃袋内の 炎が 強まり パワーも どんどん あふれ出すのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand le feu dans son corps s’embrase, sa vitesse et son agilité augmentent. En cas d’urgence, il crache de la fumée."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando las llamas de su interior se avivan, aumenta su velocidad y agilidad. Emite humo si está en peligro."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体内の 炎が 燃え上がると 動きの キレと スピードが 増す。 ピンチになると 煙を 噴き出す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":499,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",28],[14,"level-up",28],[15,"level-up",28],[16,"level-up",28],[17,"level-up",28],[18,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]